WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.475
Five pieces, each out by five centimetres, add up to more error.

2
00:00:05.326 --> 00:00:08.976
Five pieces, each measured to the nearest tenth of a metre.

3
00:00:09.854 --> 00:00:14.779
Each could be five centimetres out, and the total has a lowest and highest below.

4
00:00:18.887 --> 00:00:23.237
The gap between the lowest and the highest stays the same, half a metre.
